{"parse": {"title": "“箱中之主”王冠", "pageid": 123399, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"“箱中之主”王冠\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c4/Antique-v3a2_antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"“箱中之主”王冠\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-501208.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/ba/Signature-501208.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"232\" height=\"216\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"232\" data-file-height=\"216\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">某次箱中巡游的纪念，伙伴们亲手制作的王冠，它不具备任何法律效力，却只为唯一的那个人加冕。<br />在王冠的里侧有一些未署名的涂鸦，你知道她们是谁，你知道她们永远在你身边。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：321001</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E9.99.84.E5.8A.A0.E5.89.A7.E6.83.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"附加剧情\">附加剧情</span></h2><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\" style=\"transform:translateY(0); gap:20px; position:relative; flex-direction:row-reverse; margin-bottom:0.8em;\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“……实相已显现……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“步入已步入之道，行进已行进之径。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>破解危机的关键所在是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>砰——！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>呀呜！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>是谁，是谁胆敢打扰玛蒂尔达的伟大预言！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>播报，现在是莉拉妮和小春雀儿的射击比赛时间，靶子由气球派对提供。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰——砰——砰砰！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>正如水晶球所展现的，箱中正面临全新的危机。像我这样的大人，咳咳，当然不会有什么问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>但越来越多的青少年一定会造成巨大的混乱——小心尾巴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-312016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-312016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-312016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>抱歉！我、我去那边支帐篷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>根据我的观察，人们的活跃程度与巡游日倒计时正相关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我现在就要把所有的音响都接上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>……船长是一个例外，她的情绪持续高昂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>所以你瞧见那个办法了吗，布翁尼小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>当然，如预言所示，我们仿佛身处混沌之海上的小船，一群盲目的愚者正在胡乱划桨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>而最关键的就是要拥立一位愚人之王，你们知道，所有的“城邦”都需要一位“国王”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>鉴于玛蒂尔达永远是无可争议的天才，不如我们拥立——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>维尔汀！我们给维尔汀做一个王冠吧，还有花车，这样我们可以带着她的塑像巡游，还有满天的糖纸，就像故事里那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我没意见，她是头儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>对……对，维尔汀，不过别忘了，是谁提出了这个伟大的构想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>在妈妈恢复之前，玛蒂尔达是全世界最厉害的占卜师！</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来源\">来源</span></h2><div class=\"no-indent\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:500px\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/2025%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8#胜者与愚众\" title=\"2025箱中巡游#胜者与愚众\"><img alt=\"Banner 箱中巡游倒错狂欢.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Banner_%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8%E5%80%92%E9%94%99%E7%8B%82%E6%AC%A2.jpg/800px-Banner_%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8%E5%80%92%E9%94%99%E7%8B%82%E6%AC%A2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Banner_%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8%E5%80%92%E9%94%99%E7%8B%82%E6%AC%A2.jpg/1200px-Banner_%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8%E5%80%92%E9%94%99%E7%8B%82%E6%AC%A2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5d/Banner_%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8%E5%80%92%E9%94%99%E7%8B%82%E6%AC%A2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1202\" data-file-height=\"210\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n活动任务奖励 - <a href=\"/wiki/2025%E7%AE%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B8#胜者与愚众\" title=\"2025箱中巡游\">胜者与愚众</a></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "收藏品"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">“箱中之主”王冠 <small style=\"color: grey\">Crown of the \"Suitcase King\"</small></span></span>"}}